    "text": "If the equation of the parabola, whose vertex is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the directrix is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
